        "text": "\n  \n  \n  \n  架构决策\n  专业知识 + 深度实战\n  大量项目经验（占大头）\n",
        "sha256": "a3b02915a0a028d8d97bf1ba818a75ad63f9779d0887fb28486d7a226805623c"
      },
      {
        "id": "source-diagram-04",
