      },
      {
        "id": "source-diagram-05",
        "path": "content/posts/ai-coding-core-practice/media/svg/source-diagram-05.svg",
        "text": "\n  目标模式失控：芝诺乌龟式拆分\n  \n  拆3步\n  再拆2步\n  再拆…\n  ?\n  永远觉得\"还差一点\"，永远到不了终点\n\n  渐进模式：小步 + 验收\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  每次一个简单功能，验收通过再继续\n",
        "sha256": "56bccb8d862d142a54b367aa93b159137ce5da00987657edc3ff421986e7c62f"
      },
      {
        "id": "source-diagram-06",
        "path": "content/posts/ai-coding-core-practice/media/svg/source-diagram-06.svg",
