        "text": "",
        "sha256": "b8e5c7dac82137772f5167768f239df399a2220358bf91efa968af583fb21ac0"
      },
      {
        "id": "source-diagram-09",
        "path": "content/posts/ai-coding-core-practice/media/svg/source-diagram-09.svg",
        "text": "\n  \n    从零手写\n    \n    5~7 万行\n    每个功能重写 N 遍\n\n    引入组件库 / SDK\n    \n    几百行\n    富文本渲染组件库\n    评论 / 登录 SDK\n    一次接入，处处复用\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n  \n",
        "sha256": "6de3f69d61fae867a9c723a4d147f31486d5c7a17bc78863c7ea8e37d6da832c"
      },
      {
